{
  "id": "craft-class",
  "title": "手作課做作品",
  "titleEn": "Making Crafts in Art Class",
  "category": "校園學習",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/craft-class.webp",
    "alt": "在明亮溫馨的美術教室裡，幾位小學生圍坐在木製大桌子旁開心地做美勞，桌上擺著色紙、安全剪刀與膠水，孩子們專注地剪貼並展示色彩豐富的手工作品。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mia and Leo sit together at a big "
        },
        {
          "text": "table",
          "wordIds": [
            "table"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " in art class."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Mia 和 Leo 一起坐在美勞課的大桌子旁。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The teacher smiles and reminds everyone, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Be careful with ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "be-careful-with-scissors"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "scissors",
          "phraseIds": [
            "be-careful-with-scissors"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "scissors"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "be-careful-with-scissors"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "老師微笑著提醒大家：「使用剪刀要小心。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mia cuts a bright sheet of "
        },
        {
          "text": "paper",
          "wordIds": [
            "paper"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "What a pretty ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-a-pretty-color"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "color",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-a-pretty-color"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "color"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-a-pretty-color"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Mia 剪著一張鮮豔的紙並說：「多漂亮的顏色啊！」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo wants to paste paper shapes and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pass me the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "pass-me-the-glue-please"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "glue",
          "phraseIds": [
            "pass-me-the-glue-please"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "glue"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", please.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "pass-me-the-glue-please"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 想黏貼紙貼片，便問：「請把膠水拿給我好嗎。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mia hands him the "
        },
        {
          "text": "glue",
          "wordIds": [
            "glue"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with a friendly smile."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Mia 帶著友善的微笑把膠水遞給他。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo holds up his paper lion and cheers, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at my ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-my-craft"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "craft",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-my-craft"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "craft"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-my-craft"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 舉起他的紙獅子並歡呼：「看我的手工作品！」"
    }
  ],
